# Trivy ignore list — suppress known accepted risks only.
#
# Format (one ID per line):
#   CVE-2024-12345
#   GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz
#
# Rules:
# - Every entry MUST include justification in the PR that adds it.
# - Prefer fixing/upgrading over suppressing.
# - Review suppressions quarterly in Security → Code scanning alerts.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-00000  # accepted: dev-only transitive dep; tracked in QC-YYYYMMDD-NN
